{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0333_1000_p", "source_sha256": "30d696d42c9ca01388f2a81ec34a01ed57b9703a00dafefad99df1bf863a35fe", "ja": "（『ヨルノオルカ』との対談のおかげか、通常公演の\n客層も幅広くなってきた……いいことだな！）", "zh": "（也许是因为和《夜之虎鲸》进行访谈的缘故，普通公演的观众群体也变得更加广泛了……这是好事啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0333_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "d35e09b2c35f277c3dcdb375cb8b1ffa45ecc8bacbb44fb84db16f2006ad7973", "ja": "ふう～、大丈夫だったでしょうか……？\nミステイクには見えていないはず……！", "zh": "呼～，应该没出什么问题吧……？\n应该没被看出是失误……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0333_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f470f5d37c31a6e5c8742fab1240958bc7a13f2066e5077515030662a064244f", "ja": "ロコ、お疲れさま。客席にきちんとアピール\nできてる、いい公演だったと思うぞ！", "zh": "ROCO，辛苦了。我觉得这是场很棒的公演，确实有好好向观众展现自己！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0333_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "792fe03cbebf4a114382590d23c2fb197fe48b0ca8400929da858fe3d4f17022", "ja": "はっ、{$P$}！　お疲れさまです。\nそう言ってもらえるとホッとします……♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！辛苦了。听你这么说，我就放心了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0333_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b8dfba298d8719394f5ac7fe4af374cd24e3ef296747d40c7cc08a3f706ae71e", "ja": "ところで……最後の曲、ダンスにアレンジを\n入れていたよな？　かなりゆっくりめで……。", "zh": "对了……最后一首歌的舞蹈里加入了编排吧？而且动作放得相当慢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0333_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "f1d39c75f4053888b2152d8dd93ad20ab00917dce959400636358f1d8e4b68cc", "ja": "うっ！？　さ、さすが{$P$}、\nシャープですね……。", "zh": "呜！？不、不愧是{$P$}，真敏锐啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0333_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "c1bb4b408e1f570648386e054938176b5a5bc9678e77b25bc7cc68d1707bcce4", "ja": "あ、あれは、違うんですよ！　タイアードで、\n手を抜いたわけでは決してなくて……！", "zh": "啊，那个，不是那样的！我是因为累了，绝对不是故意偷懒……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0333_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5194e466e0a8605c33e6bceb3b3f398c21a3e228d6429b2d4aacf43108c9a14e", "ja": "うん、大きな動きに切り替えたんだよな。\n今日は客席の後ろのほう、子どもが多かったから。", "zh": "嗯，你是切换成幅度更大的动作了吧。\n因为今天观众席后排有很多小孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0333_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "8bd78062b82213dd0f7cd478c7046cfa9de9109ecfd9208e456951d9d6c50186", "ja": "！　はっ、はい！　イグザクトリーです！\n遠くからでもロコのダンスが見えるように……。", "zh": "！啊，是、是的！完全正确！这样一来，即使从远处也能看到ROCO的舞蹈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0333_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "ee6f556fe5e711d508a9546f548cfc69cb7fed048f4c8dcb8dcb77b428272b08", "ja": "そこに気づいてくれるとは……\nやっぱりシャープですね、ふふふ♪", "zh": "居然注意到了这一点……果然很敏锐呢，呵呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0333_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0c8e47e88c5d8b144ac16735836acdcf3ef974c632e8dec8e4f283754731b29f", "ja": "それくらいはわかるよ。子ども達、楽しそうだったな。\nここから見ててわかるくらい、笑顔だったから。", "zh": "这种程度我还是看得出来的。孩子们看起来很开心啊。\n他们笑得那么灿烂，从这里都能看得出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0333_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "38c02447dc3b7de4490d44b8a815a56a406ce8d4cf37de932454224435c44bea", "ja": "そうですよね……。\nよかった……♪", "zh": "是啊……。\n太好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0333_1012_p", "source_sha256": "bb6883cb0c25be6bfe867c5bab12ef553eb4214c57b4f2cc3eb7e9ec5cf7bf6e", "ja": "あんな風にアドリブで対応できるなんて、\nアイドルとしての成長を感じたよ。すごいぞ、ロコ！", "zh": "能像那样通过即兴发挥来应变，\n让我感受到了你作为偶像的成长。真了不起啊，ROCO！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0333_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "511cda47d9643c480aa42b2eeb694e62cb4ab4f6d0b262b84c4468f659f763d4", "ja": "えへへ♪　アーティストがフレキシブルであることは\n当然です！　でも、それは自分のためだけではなく……", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 艺术家保持灵活可是理所当然的！不过，这不仅仅是为了自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0333_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "5079e2e54ad206d22b18151d641dd4ba8fd0d015997fab94ee284ecfdc247bf3", "ja": "新しい価値をクリエイトしてくれる誰かのために、\nオールウェイズに……はっ！？", "zh": "为了能够给创造全新价值的某个人，\n随时都……哈！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0333_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "6d27a7727ad9056acb6c9b9fe869fce929707eb4ba82ea97857340900b6efcdf", "ja": "オールウェイズ、インプレッションでビルドする\nアート……あえてテーマを持たず……ぶつぶつ。", "zh": "永远用灵感构筑艺术……刻意不设主题……嘟嘟囔囔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0333_1016_p", "source_sha256": "79272fb06da220dea5377788f534480401e26a6337858d11ad33688eb40f4f64", "ja": "ロコ？　ええと……何か思いついちゃったのか？\n一旦落ち着いて、先に汗を拭いて着替えを……。", "zh": "ROCO？呃……是突然想到什么了吗？\n先冷静一下，先擦擦汗，换身衣服……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0333_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "ba4814a09706998ca4fc3d4b60565f9bba0103d893b0efe3663315b333f02fab", "ja": "それどころじゃありません！　次のロコアートの\nアイディア、急いでノートにまとめなくっちゃ！", "zh": "才不是忙那个的时候！下一个ROCO艺术的点子，得赶紧整理到笔记本上才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0333_1018_p", "source_sha256": "018a9908f8c06715d3656a396440156c2d5b3f8b7ee6744b068413b970966259", "ja": "あ、ちょっと……風邪引いちゃうから！　ロコー！", "zh": "啊，等一下……会感冒的！ROCO——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
